{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Story\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the year 30XX, the Space Rabbit lived peacefully on the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one day, while traveling between planets aboard a spaceship, it collided with a meteor and crash-landed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The crash site was \u201cOld Earth,\u201d a planet once inhabited by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to gravitational anomalies, everything in this strange world may float\u2014or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapting to this bizarre environment were the creatures known as \u201cOld Rabbits.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can the Space Rabbit overcome this strange planet and safely return to the Moon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Climbing Action\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The spaceship that will return you to the Moon lies at the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll find various carrots scattered about\u2014these serve as fuel for the spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more carrots you collect, the greater your chance of returning home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey back, you will face three meteor showers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you survive all three, you can safely return to the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some \u201cOld Rabbits\u201d will teach you how to jump in exchange for one Golden Carrot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more jumps you can perform, the easier your journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010RTA\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game may shatter the conventions of Real-Time Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, effort is key\u2014but sometimes, all you need is luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your completion time is recorded under various challenge conditions, such as \u201cNo Jump Unlocked\u201d or \u201cUsing Specific Shortcuts.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge in your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Extras\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special costumes for the Space Rabbit are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They unlock when certain conditions are met\u2014aim to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good Luck!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748400?t=1750387289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748400/798042a153d3cdafc51e11d098ee83c805db3445/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750387289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748400/628731a0e11a5ac3e7b1703e778d9a3ec5d918ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750387289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748400/628731a0e11a5ac3e7b1703e778d9a3ec5d918ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750387289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Story\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the year 30XX, the Space Rabbit lived peacefully on the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one day, while traveling between planets aboard a spaceship, it collided with a meteor and crash-landed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The crash site was \u201cOld Earth,\u201d a planet once inhabited by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to gravitational anomalies, everything in this strange world may float\u2014or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapting to this bizarre environment were the creatures known as \u201cOld Rabbits.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can the Space Rabbit overcome this strange planet and safely return to the Moon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Climbing Action\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The spaceship that will return you to the Moon lies at the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll find various carrots scattered about\u2014these serve as fuel for the spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more carrots you collect, the greater your chance of returning home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey back, you will face three meteor showers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you survive all three, you can safely return to the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some \u201cOld Rabbits\u201d will teach you how to jump in exchange for one Golden Carrot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more jumps you can perform, the easier your journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010RTA\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game may shatter the conventions of Real-Time Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, effort is key\u2014but sometimes, all you need is luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your completion time is recorded under various challenge conditions, such as \u201cNo Jump Unlocked\u201d or \u201cUsing Specific Shortcuts.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge in your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Extras\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special costumes for the Space Rabbit are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They unlock when certain conditions are met\u2014aim to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good Luck!</p>","developers":["POKKUN\u3000WORLD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748400/f7cc3c82a32c6002b80eec4c9735fd6bb65ae675/header.jpg?t=1750387289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158802,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158802/movie480.mp4?t=1750387287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158802/movie_max.mp4?t=1750387287"},"name":"PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158802/127fcf7371df0cde7ad294551e6d0e575222a482/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750387287","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158802/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750387287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158802/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750387287"}}],"name":"SPACE RABBIT","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10/11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-8400 2.8GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD(Required)\u3000</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and ope